  <content>
  <section><title>Getting Ready for Unit 2</title>
<para>To be ready for this unit, you need to be able to:</para>
<list>
  <item>Determine if an ordered pair is a solution to a linear equation.</item>
  <item>Work with slope-intercept form of a linear equation.</item>
  <item>Find the <emphasis>x</emphasis>- and <emphasis>y</emphasis>-intercepts of a line when given its equation.</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated">
</list>
<para>Next, you will answer some questions that will help you see how ready you are for this unit. If you need help, some mini-lessons will help you brush up on anything you need to work on.</para></section>
</content>
</document>
